# aura-engine
===
 Free audiophile music player and FIR upsampler (HQPlayer alternative) for Windows, Linux and macOS. Filters up to 1G taps, Hybrid-Phase, bit-perfect output, FLAC up to 768 kHz, DSD256. Aura Streamer: network streamer and UPnP/OpenHome renderer played from your phone. Internet radio, ASIO input. Rust. aura-engine.app..
